{
  "label": "soccer15",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label soccer15:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sky",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/BGs/sky.png",
      "alt": "sky"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I show up at the soccer field to see how Miku’s practice is going.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It's another early day, so I wouldn’t be surprised if it was just her here right now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I slowly make my way across the school grounds, listening close for the sound of a whistle or...anything to signify that practice is in session-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei! Over here!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But the noise I hear before anything is Miku's voice, calling out to me before I even know where she is.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikukarin1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mikukarin1.webp",
      "alt": "mikukarin1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Heya! Come to watch us kick some balls around again?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": As long as they’re not mine.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...............ah.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Good morning to you as well, Karin.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is Miku making you carry her around the field as training or something?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That...That wasn’t the plan, but...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’re just helpin’ each other stretch so that we’re all loosened up when it comes time for the main event later!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is what you're doing really going to loosen Karin up? Shouldn't you...maybe switch positions every thirty seconds or something?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikukarin2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mikukarin2.webp",
      "alt": "mikukarin2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think I might be a little too heavy for Miku to carry like this...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Karin’s gettin’ plenty loose by bendin' over like this, Sensei!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can you say that again, but in a more seductive voice?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I've never tried a seductive voice before, so I'm gonna say no!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I guess this is more like strength training for her, though. But hey, if I get a chance to ride a friend, I'm gonna ride a friend.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm also not sure if this...even counts as strength training since Miku is by far the lightest girl on the team...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikukarin3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mikukarin3.webp",
      "alt": "mikukarin3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey! Less talkin’ and more stretchin’! If you lose focus, you’re gonna drop me and I’m gonna break my ankles!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I need my ankles to do...ankle stuff! Like running and...jumping! And...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ankle stuff!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm going to try and stay quiet so...Miku can keep doing ankle stuff...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Miku, you should be nicer to the girl who’s keeping you suspended in mid-air right now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikukarin4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mikukarin4.webp",
      "alt": "mikukarin4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey! Who do ya think you’re talkin’ to?! I’m the captain of this ship and if I say starboard you better do whatever the heck that means!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Isn’t that just a part of the ship?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That's it! You're walkin' the plank!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sorry, S...Sensei...Miku is unusually fired up today...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Any reason why?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikukarin5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mikukarin5.webp",
      "alt": "mikukarin5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh! That’s right! I totally forgot to tell ya, but we’re havin’ a full-on practice game between the girls later on.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’re probably gonna be here all day so if you wanna stick around and watch, you totally should!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe. We'll see how I feel once the afternoon rolls around.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You really have enough players for a practice game, though?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, normally we wouldn’t. But Karin’s on the softball team too, so she pulled some strings and got a few of them to agree to play!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re on two teams at once, Karin? Isn’t that a little tiring?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikukarin6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mikukarin6.webp",
      "alt": "mikukarin6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, no! Not at all!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I love pretty much all sports, so I figure out how to make it work.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure, it can be a little tiring at times...but it's not like there's really anything else I have to do other than studying.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Plus, my body was...kind of built for stuff like this, so it’s a lot easier on me than it would be on someone like my sister.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Where is Kirin, by the way? I thought she was gonna show up early too?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikukarin7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mikukarin7.webp",
      "alt": "mikukarin7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who even knows? That girl is always doing her own thing.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s going to get her into trouble one day, I just know it...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Karin, are you really okay just...continuously balancing Miku like that? You’ve barely moved since I got here.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikukarin8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mikukarin8.webp",
      "alt": "mikukarin8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, right. Miku is on my back. I totally forgot.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Am I...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Am I really that light?...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Karin arches her back and forces Miku to dismount.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Fortunately, Miku does not fall and her ankles remain intact, ensuring that she will still be able to do ankle stuff in the near future.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Whatever that means.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikukarin9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mikukarin9.webp",
      "alt": "mikukarin9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sorry Karin, I’d offer to lift you up and stuff, but I’m pretty sure you’d crush me.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don't weigh that much...And you can't just only train cardio, Miku. You need to be training your entire body.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikukarin10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mikukarin10.webp",
      "alt": "mikukarin10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I know, but...You’re just so muscley that there’s no way I’d be able to even get you off the ground! It'd be a lost cause!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Didn’t you try to pick me up the other day? I’m bigger than Karin.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikukarin11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mikukarin11.webp",
      "alt": "mikukarin11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah and how well did that work out? It was more like a backwards bear hug than anything else.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikukarin12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mikukarin12.webp",
      "alt": "mikukarin12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sure Karin could do it, though! She’s probably even stronger than you, Sensei!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You should look at her abs!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Karin! Lift up your shirt and show Sensei what you’re working with!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikukarin13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mikukarin13.webp",
      "alt": "mikukarin13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": W-w-what?!? N-n-no way!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There’s...There's no way I could ever do something like that! Not in a gazillion years! Is gazillion even a number?!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Would Sensei even want to see something like that?! Because I sure as heck wouldn't if I was him! No way! Nuh-uh!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not gonna lie, I kind of want to see.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikukarin14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mikukarin14.webp",
      "alt": "mikukarin14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why?!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Also, is it just me or am I really loud right now?!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hehehe...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This...This, children...is the scent of love.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikukarin15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mikukarin15.webp",
      "alt": "mikukarin15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": L-L-L-L-L-LOVE?!?!?",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Miku! W-What are you talking about?!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei, as ya can see, Karin ain't very good with boys. She has this thing where whenever she tries to talk to one, she gets all...broken.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Miku! What do you think you’re telling him?! H-H-He doesn’t want to hear-",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not gonna lie, I kind of want to hear.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikukarin16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mikukarin16.webp",
      "alt": "mikukarin16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why are you doing this to me?!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you like watching me suffer?!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course not. I just think you’re really cute when you get flustered and I’d like to see a little more of that side of you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikukarin17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mikukarin17.webp",
      "alt": "mikukarin17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": C...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Huh?",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": C...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What?",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What did you say?",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s-",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Where am I?",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ahh, youth...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sunburn...sweat...hormones running wild...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What a time to be alive.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": C...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": C...C...C...C...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow, she really is bad with boys.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikukarin18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mikukarin18.webp",
      "alt": "mikukarin18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Duh! Ya think your old pal Miku would lie to ya about something as silly as that?!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’re brothers in arms, Sensei! We’re gonna take on the world!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What does that have to do with the way Karin handles men?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikukarin19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mikukarin19.webp",
